{"id":"peluca","lemma":"peluca","pos":"noun","rank":3890,"glosses":["wig"],"ipa":"/peˈluka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pelucas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-peluca.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Eso es una peluca?","en":"Is that a wig?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/262570","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Vuelve a ponerte la peluca.","en":"Put your wig back on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455424","words":[{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Cuando se puso la peluca, parecía una mujer.","en":"With the wig on, he looked like a woman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689134","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"Tom lleva peluca.","en":"Tom wears a wig.","words":[null,{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},null]},{"text":"Llevará un tiempo acostumbrarse a llevar una peluca.","en":"It'll take some time to get used to wearing a wig.","words":[{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"accustom","l":"acostumbrar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to take somewhere"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}